# 02 — Kẻ Địch / Yokai (Enemies) — Asset Prompts

- **Danh mục:** Kẻ địch Yokai (10 đơn vị: 6 P0 + 4 P1)
- **Thư mục nhận raw:** `inbox/`
- **Thư mục đích sau adapt:** `assets/sprites/enemies/`
- **Quy chuẩn chung:** Quay mặt sang **TRÁI** (tiến về phía nhà cổ), nền trắng phẳng `#FFFFFF`, không đường kẻ lưới, không chữ, căn đáy giữa (`bottom-center`).

---

## 1. Tiểu yêu (`tieu_yeu`) — [P0]

### 1.1. `tieu_yeu_walk.png` — Walk (12 frames, lưới 4×3)
```
2D Japanese Edo-period chibi game sprite sheet, 4 columns by 3 rows (12 equal-sized square cells), seamless walking cycle animation of a cute mischievous chibi Tanuki yokai (raccoon-dog spirit) wearing a woven straw conical hat (kasa) and carrying a small brown cloth sack on its back, facing left. Frame progression from top-left to bottom-right: bouncy full 12-frame marching walk cycle moving left with swinging arms, bobbing straw hat, and wagging striped tail. Consistent character scale and bottom-center ground alignment in every cell. Hand-drawn 2D game art style, thick clean dark-brown ink outlines, warm earthy brown and straw gold cel-shaded watercolor coloring. Pure flat solid white background (#FFFFFF), no grid lines, no borders, no text, no drop shadow on the background.
```

### 1.2. `tieu_yeu_attack.png` — Attack (12 frames, lưới 4×3)
```
2D Japanese Edo-period chibi game sprite sheet, 4 columns by 3 rows (12 equal-sized square cells), melee bite-and-claw attack animation of a cute mischievous chibi Tanuki yokai wearing a straw conical hat and cloth sack, facing left. Frame progression from top-left to bottom-right: frames 1-3 lean back winding up; frames 4-7 lunge forward to the left swiping paws and biting fiercely with puffed cheeks; frames 8-12 pull back with bouncy recovery to stance. Consistent character scale and bottom-center ground alignment in every cell. Hand-drawn 2D game art style, thick clean dark-brown ink outlines, warm earthy brown and straw gold cel-shaded watercolor coloring. Pure flat solid white background (#FFFFFF), no grid lines, no borders, no text, no drop shadow on the background.
```

### 1.3. `tieu_yeu_die.png` — Defeat / Poof (12 frames, lưới 4×3)
```
2D Japanese Edo-period chibi game sprite sheet, 4 columns by 3 rows (12 equal-sized square cells), cute cartoon defeat animation of a chibi Tanuki yokai wearing a straw conical hat, facing left. Frame progression from top-left to bottom-right: frames 1-4 startled knockback with dizzy spiral eyes and straw hat popping up; frames 5-8 spin and shrink into a cute puff of white-tan yokai smoke with a floating leaf; frames 9-12 smoke cloud expands and softly dissipates. Consistent character scale and bottom-center ground alignment in every cell. Hand-drawn 2D game art style, thick clean dark-brown ink outlines, warm cel-shaded watercolor coloring. Pure flat solid white background (#FFFFFF), no grid lines, no borders, no text, no drop shadow on the background.
